<th id="S4.T2.4.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;">SDD</span></th>
<td id="S4.T2.4.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">0.23</span></span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.4.1.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">28.79</span></span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.4.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">0.46</span></span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.4.1.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">52.63</span></span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.4.1.4.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">18.06</span></span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.4.1.4.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9D9FF;"><span id="S4.T2.4.1.4.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">0.411</span></span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</span></div>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Following the evaluation protocol of RePaint <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lugmayr et al. (2022)</a></cite>,
we assess in‑painting, out‑painting, and super‑resolution
without task‑specific fine‑tuning.
A set of 300 validation images is sampled from <span id="S4.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">AFHQ</span> validation set.
For the first two tasks, we reuse the publicly released masks of <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lugmayr et al. (2022)</a></cite>; Table <a href="#S4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 4.3 Zero-Shot Performance ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Scale-Wise VAR is Secretly Discrete Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> compare the <span id="S4.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">VAR</span>
with SDD across four metrics.
SDD consistently outperforms the baseline: In‑painting. LPIPS drops from 0.26 to 0.23 and FID from 29.92 to 28.79. Out‑painting. Similar gains are observed with LPIPS <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.48\!\rightarrow\!0.46" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>0.46</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.48\!\rightarrow\!0.46</annotation></semantics></math> and FID <math id="S4.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="54.01\!\rightarrow\!52.63" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mn>52.63</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">54.01\!\rightarrow\!52.63</annotation></semantics></math>. Super‑resolution. SSIM rises from 0.403 to 0.411,dB, while PSNR improves from 18.01 to 18.06.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span><span id="S4.T3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ablation study across datasets:</span> SR: Simple Resampling. MR: Mask Resampling. cfg: Optimized Classifier-Free Guidance.</figcaption>
<div id="S4.T3.4" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:298.1pt;height:57.2pt;vertical-align:-27.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-105.4pt,20.2pt) scale(0.585861266513685,0.585861266513685) ;">
<table id="S4.T3.4.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T3.4.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
